ms in military flight procedures.</p><p><span class="pill death-grade">Baseline dossier published; continuing evidence review</span></p><div class="death-facts"><span>3 Apr 1996</span><span>Near Dubrovnik, Croatia</span><span>Accident</span></div><div class="cta-row small"><a class="btn" href="death-file-ron-brown.html">Open dossier</a><a class="btn alt" href="death-file-ron-brown.html#signal-drop">Signal Drop</a></div></article><article class="card death-card" data-death-card="william-colby"><span class="label">1996 · Intelligence chief · Accident</span><h3>William Colby</h3><p>Colby had led the CIA during major disclosures and possessed extensive knowledge of covert operations, congressional investigations, and Cold War networks. His death intensified public fascination with the private lives and secrets of former intelligence chiefs.</p><p><span class="pill death-grade">Baseline dossier published; continuing evidence review</span></p><div class="death-facts"><span>27 Apr 1996</span><span>Rock Point, Maryland, United States</span><span>Accidental drowning</span></div><div class="cta-row small"><a class="btn" href="death-file-william-colby.html">Open dossier</a><a class="btn alt" href="death-file-william-colby.html#signal-drop">Signal Drop</a></div></article><article class="card death-card" data-death-card="veronica-guerin"><span class="label">1996 · Journalist · Organised crime</span><h3>Veronica Guerin</h3><p>Guerin exposed major drug traffickers and criminal assets in Ireland. Her murder led to major criminal-assets legislation and transformed Irish organised-crime enforcement.</p><p><span class="pill death-grade">Baseline dossier published; continuing evidence review</span></p><div class="death-facts"><span>26 Jun 1996</span><span>Dublin, Ireland</span><span>Homicide</span></div><div class="cta-row small"><a class="btn" href="death-file-veronica-guerin.html">Open dossier</a><a class="btn alt" href="death-file-veronica-guerin.html#signal-drop">Signal Drop</a></div></article></div></section><section class="section wrap"><h2>Year Pattern Boundary</h2><article class="card"><p>Shared dates, institutions, investigators, lawyers, beneficiaries, or security failures are leads for comparison. A pattern does not establish coordination.</p></article></section><script type="application/json" id="compatibility-marker-vault" data-cleanup-marker="deep-cleanup">{"status":"compatibility-routes-preserved-with-clean-public-copy","checked":"2026-08-03","routes":["downloads/forum-posts.json","downloads/forum-posts.md","feed-center.html","share-center.html","launch-room.html","offer-center.html","source-document-vault.html","evidence-vault.html","black-file.html"]}</script></main><footer class="footer wrap"><p><strong>THE DEATH FILES</strong> — evidence first, conclusion second.</p><p class="warning">Inclusion does not imply murder, conspiracy, or wrongdoing by any connected person. Official findings, established evidence, disputed claims, analytical inference, and speculation are displayed separately.</p></footer></div><script src="matrix.js"></script><script src="death-files.js"></script></body></html>